(2116934, 290105, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge. Perfect choice for b&amp;w, as shadows are usually gray, and to try to make them stand out you have to eliminate the color from the rest of the image. The only negative is the pose - looks terribly uncomfortable and in my opinion is not in a perfect harmony with your title.<br/>Still love it, bumping up to 8.<br/> <br/>Good luck, Cindi!</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge. Perfect choice for b&w, as shadows are usually gray, and to try to make them stand out you have to eliminate the color from the rest of the image. The only negative is the pose - looks terribly uncomfortable and in my opinion is not in a perfect harmony with your title.Still love it, bumping up to 8. Good luck, Cindi!', '2006-02-03 01:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
