(2117039, 290259, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and overall composition.  I think it looks a tad bit off having the back of her (his?) head cut off by the window frame.  If she would have been one step forward it would have been much more powerful.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice tones and overall composition.  I think it looks a tad bit off having the back of her (his?) head cut off by the window frame.  If she would have been one step forward it would have been much more powerful.TC', '2006-02-03 02:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117041, 290090, 9906, '<td valign="top">A little corny but a nice shadow none the less with great choice of background.  Love the red tones.<br/>TC</td>', 'A little corny but a nice shadow none the less with great choice of background.  Love the red tones.TC', '2006-02-03 02:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117043, 290327, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very well done!  Great angle.  Love the fact that you turned it into a story.  Almost looks like a Joey Lawrence shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very well done!  Great angle.  Love the fact that you turned it into a story.  Almost looks like a Joey Lawrence shot.TC', '2006-02-03 03:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117045, 290061, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looks a tad bit oversharpened and your hand shadow looks odd.  Probably a trick of perspective though.<br/>TC</td>', 'Looks a tad bit oversharpened and your hand shadow looks odd.  Probably a trick of perspective though.TC', '2006-02-03 03:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117047, 290055, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Was this a double exposure?  I didn''t think it was possible to get two shadows with a single exposure...  Didn''t think about trying it back lit though.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute!  Was this a double exposure?  I didn''t think it was possible to get two shadows with a single exposure...  Didn''t think about trying it back lit though.TC', '2006-02-03 03:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
