(2117049, 290105, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great composition and posing.  I can''t imagine trying to do a shadow shot in a studio with good even lighting on the background...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great composition and posing.  I can''t imagine trying to do a shadow shot in a studio with good even lighting on the background...TC', '2006-02-03 03:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
