(2119604, 290258, 18799, '<td valign="top">You know the saying "The devil''s in the details"?  That''s what this is too me - some "if onlys".  If only that red bucket wasn''t there to distract attention.  If only that whatever it is wasn''t bisecting the head.  Plus, you should consider cropping a lot off the left as it does nothing for the image.  I know it sounds like I don''t like this image, but actually I do.  If only...   6</td>', 'You know the saying "The devil''s in the details"?  That''s what this is too me - some "if onlys".  If only that red bucket wasn''t there to distract attention.  If only that whatever it is wasn''t bisecting the head.  Plus, you should consider cropping a lot off the left as it does nothing for the image.  I know it sounds like I don''t like this image, but actually I do.  If only...   6', '2006-02-03 19:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
