(2120632, 290098, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. Neat use of lighting. I think this shot would even stand on it''s own as an interesting abstract even without the context of the challenge. I do hope voters give this more than a pursory glance. It takes a moment for the full force of the pose to sink in. But once you get there, very, very cool.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is pretty cool. Neat use of lighting. I think this shot would even stand on it''s own as an interesting abstract even without the context of the challenge. I do hope voters give this more than a pursory glance. It takes a moment for the full force of the pose to sink in. But once you get there, very, very cool.  Nice job.', '2006-02-04 01:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120636, 290262, 44172, '<td valign="top">the quality could be a wee bit better (lighting or focus maybe?) - I''m having a hard time seeing which part of this image is "your shadow" - it seems like they are objects in your home - and going by the title - I think that''s what you were going for - which in my opinion doesn''t meet the challenge because I can''t see "your shadow"</td>', 'the quality could be a wee bit better (lighting or focus maybe?) - I''m having a hard time seeing which part of this image is "your shadow" - it seems like they are objects in your home - and going by the title - I think that''s what you were going for - which in my opinion doesn''t meet the challenge because I can''t see "your shadow"', '2006-02-04 01:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120641, 290182, 44172, '<td valign="top">you''ve probably already received several comments concerning how this should be sized larger - it''s rather small to appreciate any kind of quality</td>', 'you''ve probably already received several comments concerning how this should be sized larger - it''s rather small to appreciate any kind of quality', '2006-02-04 01:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120653, 289976, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Very cool image. That is a totally great setting for this creative concept. Curious how you did it. Is that a cutout on the ground? I''m wondering how the voters will receive this photo. I for one, am digging it :-) A refreshing, clever break from the ''ominous shadow lurching over crouched, frightened person'' shot. Would stand on it''s own nicely even outside of the context of this challenge. Nice job, and good luck :-)</td>', 'Nice composition. Very cool image. That is a totally great setting for this creative concept. Curious how you did it. Is that a cutout on the ground? I''m wondering how the voters will receive this photo. I for one, am digging it :-) A refreshing, clever break from the ''ominous shadow lurching over crouched, frightened person'' shot. Would stand on it''s own nicely even outside of the context of this challenge. Nice job, and good luck :-)', '2006-02-04 01:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120660, 290139, 19831, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Interesting use of the purple. I like the clean, simple yet bold composition. The title works well with the pose, how the subject is facing the left, symbolizing a more introverted look at the past. I''m wondering if maybe some levels tweaking could make the shadow just a little darker and stronger, maybe strengthening the presentation a little? Although, maybe your intent is to maintain a softer, more delicate feel. Nice job :-)</td>', 'Nice idea. Interesting use of the purple. I like the clean, simple yet bold composition. The title works well with the pose, how the subject is facing the left, symbolizing a more introverted look at the past. I''m wondering if maybe some levels tweaking could make the shadow just a little darker and stronger, maybe strengthening the presentation a little? Although, maybe your intent is to maintain a softer, more delicate feel. Nice job :-)', '2006-02-04 01:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120664, 290067, 19831, '<td valign="top">Cool idea! I think you need a bigger amp though, that fender doesn''t look loud enough ;-)</td>', 'Cool idea! I think you need a bigger amp though, that fender doesn''t look loud enough ;-)', '2006-02-04 01:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120677, 290148, 44172, '<td valign="top">Did I find you? I like the title and I''ve been looking at it trying to figure out if this is the photographer''s shadow or the shadow of somebody else that the photographer took a shot at - it really is at such "A Different Angle" - I''m not really sure how this was able to be all lined up just so - good job :) (I think I recognize the hat, jacket sleeve, garage door, pose - as I''ve seen it a bunch of times - <i>and</i> that appears to be one really tiny camera!)</td>', 'Did I find you? I like the title and I''ve been looking at it trying to figure out if this is the photographer''s shadow or the shadow of somebody else that the photographer took a shot at - it really is at such "A Different Angle" - I''m not really sure how this was able to be all lined up just so - good job :) (I think I recognize the hat, jacket sleeve, garage door, pose - as I''ve seen it a bunch of times - and that appears to be one really tiny camera!)', '2006-02-04 01:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
