(2120791, 290249, 52596, '<td valign="top">I like this composition a lot - not sure the rules would allow it but I would have blurred out and darkened the textures from the garage door or whatever that is in the torso area. For some reason that distracts my eye and the fact that I associate it with a garage door takes away from the mystery of the rest of the shot. Other than that this would make a great poster! Nice work!</td>', 'I like this composition a lot - not sure the rules would allow it but I would have blurred out and darkened the textures from the garage door or whatever that is in the torso area. For some reason that distracts my eye and the fact that I associate it with a garage door takes away from the mystery of the rest of the shot. Other than that this would make a great poster! Nice work!', '2006-02-04 05:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
