(2137784, 290253, 36988, '<td valign="top">A very powerful impact combining lots of elements which to me give off a very surreal feeling. I see vulnerability AND aggression in the face and as a result I don''t know whether to feel for her or fear her... in other words, your entry told me a very emotional story... GREAT JOB! 10</td>', 'A very powerful impact combining lots of elements which to me give off a very surreal feeling. I see vulnerability AND aggression in the face and as a result I don''t know whether to feel for her or fear her... in other words, your entry told me a very emotional story... GREAT JOB! 10', '2006-02-09 18:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
