(2138457, 290074, 53104, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the use of reds in this photo!<br/>The horns (?) added on add that nice touch of evil, and the glass ball (I think it is) was a very nice choice because the light goes through it beautifully, giving it kind of magical look.<br/>Very nice!</td>', 'I absolutely love the use of reds in this photo!The horns (?) added on add that nice touch of evil, and the glass ball (I think it is) was a very nice choice because the light goes through it beautifully, giving it kind of magical look.Very nice!', '2006-02-09 21:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2138466, 290222, 53104, '<td valign="top">I love the look of fear on her face! The slight motion blur on her hands gives it that despairing look that I can''t get enough of in this picture.<br/>The blank white wall was a good idea, because you can really see the detail on the shadow.<br/>For some reason I want to see the girl in white as well, but the dark shadows on her is very nice looking too.</td>', 'I love the look of fear on her face! The slight motion blur on her hands gives it that despairing look that I can''t get enough of in this picture.The blank white wall was a good idea, because you can really see the detail on the shadow.For some reason I want to see the girl in white as well, but the dark shadows on her is very nice looking too.', '2006-02-09 21:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2138477, 290184, 53104, '<td valign="top">Positively stunning.<br/>Such a magnificent visage of the beauty of the sky and land!<br/>I love how it there is just a little strip of light near the background of the photo and it makes it look kind of like the dark part of the road is leading into the light.<br/>Excellent!</td>', 'Positively stunning.Such a magnificent visage of the beauty of the sky and land!I love how it there is just a little strip of light near the background of the photo and it makes it look kind of like the dark part of the road is leading into the light.Excellent!', '2006-02-09 21:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
