(2138941, 290252, 12253, '<td valign="top">This was one of my ribbon picks, I think the shadow and the angle/distortion gives this a very nice artistic flare.  Perhaps a touch more contrast might have been good, but I really liked it.  Gave it a 9.  Congrats on top 20 anyway!<br/> <br/>Edit: and yes, I was pretty sure it was yours!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-10 00:23:15.</i></td>', 'This was one of my ribbon picks, I think the shadow and the angle/distortion gives this a very nice artistic flare.  Perhaps a touch more contrast might have been good, but I really liked it.  Gave it a 9.  Congrats on top 20 anyway! Edit: and yes, I was pretty sure it was yours!', '2006-02-10 00:22:31.000000', '2006-02-10 00:23:15.000000', 0),
