(2139048, 290283, 28742, '<td valign="top">Getting more daring there Mandy! :) Gave it a six, mainly it was more about the model than the shadow - the shadow was incidental. My 2cents anyway. :)</td>', 'Getting more daring there Mandy! :) Gave it a six, mainly it was more about the model than the shadow - the shadow was incidental. My 2cents anyway. :)', '2006-02-10 01:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139049, 290277, 19672, '<td valign="top">Ah....congrats once again on a ribbon.  I thought this was you. Actually, I rated it about a pt lower than I probably would have had I not realized it was you.<br/> <br/>Knowing the photo was a Joey Lawrence shot I was really half expecting the shadow to be turning toward you in counter action (you know, how the shadows of ''toons always act on their own).<br/> <br/>Good job and congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Ah....congrats once again on a ribbon.  I thought this was you. Actually, I rated it about a pt lower than I probably would have had I not realized it was you. Knowing the photo was a Joey Lawrence shot I was really half expecting the shadow to be turning toward you in counter action (you know, how the shadows of ''toons always act on their own). Good job and congrats on the ribbon.', '2006-02-10 01:13:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139052, 290025, 28742, '<td valign="top">Woohoo! Nicely done, Angela! Congrats on the strong finish!</td>', 'Woohoo! Nicely done, Angela! Congrats on the strong finish!', '2006-02-10 01:14:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139056, 289945, 28742, '<td valign="top">Way to go Thomas!</td>', 'Way to go Thomas!', '2006-02-10 01:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139057, 290328, 19672, '<td valign="top">Yeah...this bombed.<br/> <br/>I only had just over an hour to compose this shot.  And I was shooting in high ISO while arranging everything.  Time ran up and I just didn''t have time to shoot it at lower ISO and process &amp; adjust for the lens and angle distortion.  <br/> <br/>I think the concept was good, and if I had more than an hour I think this idea would have come up in the top 25.  Alas, I got this in with just 2 minutes to go as it was.<br/> <br/>:|</td>', 'Yeah...this bombed. I only had just over an hour to compose this shot.  And I was shooting in high ISO while arranging everything.  Time ran up and I just didn''t have time to shoot it at lower ISO and process & adjust for the lens and angle distortion.   I think the concept was good, and if I had more than an hour I think this idea would have come up in the top 25.  Alas, I got this in with just 2 minutes to go as it was. :|', '2006-02-10 01:17:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139060, 290155, 28742, '<td valign="top">Superb! Congrats!</td>', 'Superb! Congrats!', '2006-02-10 01:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
