(2139066, 289976, 23430, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. You had some great competition too. Well done and congrats.</td>', 'Excellent shot. You had some great competition too. Well done and congrats.', '2006-02-10 01:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139067, 290277, 41522, '<td valign="top">Good work Joey, as usual.  Congrats on the ribbon.</td>', 'Good work Joey, as usual.  Congrats on the ribbon.', '2006-02-10 01:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139072, 290213, 12253, '<td valign="top">One of my 10''s.  Great job.  I like the way it''s framed in the circular distorted ground, it gives it even more dynamics.</td>', 'One of my 10''s.  Great job.  I like the way it''s framed in the circular distorted ground, it gives it even more dynamics.', '2006-02-10 01:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139076, 290283, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and softness Mandy.  I agree with Ken--a bit more emphasis on the shadow and you would have done better in the challenge, but it''s a great shot in general.  If you cover up some of the right side of this, just to the right of your left elbow, it shows how much stronger the shadow becomes in the composition, and still looks nice from the person point of view.  (But I gave you a 7 not a 6 like that cheapskate Ken ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice tones and softness Mandy.  I agree with Ken--a bit more emphasis on the shadow and you would have done better in the challenge, but it''s a great shot in general.  If you cover up some of the right side of this, just to the right of your left elbow, it shows how much stronger the shadow becomes in the composition, and still looks nice from the person point of view.  (But I gave you a 7 not a 6 like that cheapskate Ken ;) ', '2006-02-10 01:33:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139079, 289945, 36956, '<td valign="top">haha.  Thomas, I voted on this one, and I didn''t even realize it was you in the picture... I obviously need to pay a little more attention to the pictures I am voting on.  haha... good shot friend. <br/> <br/>mH<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-10 01:34:44.</i></td>', 'haha.  Thomas, I voted on this one, and I didn''t even realize it was you in the picture... I obviously need to pay a little more attention to the pictures I am voting on.  haha... good shot friend.  mH', '2006-02-10 01:34:15.000000', '2006-02-10 01:34:44.000000', 0),
