(2139238, 290249, 17126, '<td valign="top">this was my favorite one...</td>', 'this was my favorite one...', '2006-02-10 03:39:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139277, 289976, 35517, '<td valign="top">THIS IS AWESOME..... well done on your ribbon, so very well deserved... thanks for the info on how it was done... and great to see someone else do silly things with photography... top shot...</td>', 'THIS IS AWESOME..... well done on your ribbon, so very well deserved... thanks for the info on how it was done... and great to see someone else do silly things with photography... top shot...', '2006-02-10 04:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2139285, 289976, 28710, '<td valign="top">Absolutely freakin'' brilliant.<br/> <br/>I just watched Batman Returns for the first time a few days ago and thoroughly enjoyed it. I''m also a big fan of the animated series which I felt was some of the best animation on TV. <br/> <br/>I really like how the colors in the lighting match those in the movie so well. I ripped that movie to watch on my brand new PDA and that was when I realized how dark and tungsteny that whole movie is.<br/> <br/>I know it probably would have taken a fair bit of work to work out, but I would have liked the bottom furling of the cape to look a bit better.<br/> <br/>I actually liked the uneven earpeices.</td>', 'Absolutely freakin'' brilliant. I just watched Batman Returns for the first time a few days ago and thoroughly enjoyed it. I''m also a big fan of the animated series which I felt was some of the best animation on TV.  I really like how the colors in the lighting match those in the movie so well. I ripped that movie to watch on my brand new PDA and that was when I realized how dark and tungsteny that whole movie is. I know it probably would have taken a fair bit of work to work out, but I would have liked the bottom furling of the cape to look a bit better. I actually liked the uneven earpeices.', '2006-02-10 04:31:15.000000', NULL, 0),
