(2139646, 290283, 37544, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments. My comments rec where pretty interesting since I am not the only one who had their entire body in the shot along with their shadow. I am pleased with my score and I really like my picture. It is a little soft, but I liked it that way. I didn''t intend on the picture being more about me than my shadow. I still don''t see it that way. The shadow IS me too. As far as the rude emails go, I do not feel that this picture is pornographic at ALL. You can''t even see ANY private parts. I feel that it was done in very good taste. And for those of you who know me, you know this took alot of guts for me to do this. The only reason I did do it, is because I thought that the pose and the whole set-up was beautiful and artistic, not dirty.</td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments. My comments rec where pretty interesting since I am not the only one who had their entire body in the shot along with their shadow. I am pleased with my score and I really like my picture. It is a little soft, but I liked it that way. I didn''t intend on the picture being more about me than my shadow. I still don''t see it that way. The shadow IS me too. As far as the rude emails go, I do not feel that this picture is pornographic at ALL. You can''t even see ANY private parts. I feel that it was done in very good taste. And for those of you who know me, you know this took alot of guts for me to do this. The only reason I did do it, is because I thought that the pose and the whole set-up was beautiful and artistic, not dirty.', '2006-02-10 08:04:39.000000', NULL, 0),
