(2148438, 290194, 33535, '<td valign="top">don''t know if you are into it, but "Mein Kampf" is the title of Adolph Hitler''s biography and includes his race theorie and the way how he wanted to wipe out the judes. i wonder, how this stands in reference to your rather nice picture?! please think about that!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-13 20:23:40.</i></td>', 'don''t know if you are into it, but "Mein Kampf" is the title of Adolph Hitler''s biography and includes his race theorie and the way how he wanted to wipe out the judes. i wonder, how this stands in reference to your rather nice picture?! please think about that!', '2006-02-13 20:22:46.000000', '2006-02-13 20:23:40.000000', 0),
(2149273, 290155, 48592, '<td valign="top">I came to look because of the colors- such bountiful oranges and greens.  I stayed, because the photograph itself is full of magical appearances, things that seem to be one thing, but are another.  The dark person casting a reflection in the water, who is his- or herself only a shadow.  The dark tree with its beige leaves- actually a tree''s shadow surrounded by a chalkier soil.  A very beautiful, rich photograph.  Thank you!<br/> <br/>And congratulations on the justly deserved blue ribbon.</td>', 'I came to look because of the colors- such bountiful oranges and greens.  I stayed, because the photograph itself is full of magical appearances, things that seem to be one thing, but are another.  The dark person casting a reflection in the water, who is his- or herself only a shadow.  The dark tree with its beige leaves- actually a tree''s shadow surrounded by a chalkier soil.  A very beautiful, rich photograph.  Thank you! And congratulations on the justly deserved blue ribbon.', '2006-02-14 04:42:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2149275, 289976, 47294, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by muur88:</b></div><hr/><i> cool idea.  that green light area is an interesting juxtaposition with the main subject''s lighting.  very good, though i find it odd having him staring out of a closed parking garage.  did he forget to get his parking pass validated at the movie? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL - actually this was the only flaw in my plan but I was hoping no one would really pick up on it and just be too involved in the whole feel of the shot.  But you managed to pick it!!!!  BTW, I''m sure Batman goes to the movies too, you know!</td>', 'Originally posted by muur88: cool idea.  that green light area is an interesting juxtaposition with the main subject''s lighting.  very good, though i find it odd having him staring out of a closed parking garage.  did he forget to get his parking pass validated at the movie?   LOL - actually this was the only flaw in my plan but I was hoping no one would really pick up on it and just be too involved in the whole feel of the shot.  But you managed to pick it!!!!  BTW, I''m sure Batman goes to the movies too, you know!', '2006-02-14 04:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2149277, 289976, 47294, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by heatherd:</b></div><hr/><i> Cool!!! From one ex Brisbanite to another Brisbanite, well done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Go Bris-vegas and the Mighty Broncos!!! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-14 09:31:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by heatherd: Cool!!! From one ex Brisbanite to another Brisbanite, well done!   Go Bris-vegas and the Mighty Broncos!!! :)', '2006-02-14 04:50:17.000000', '2006-02-14 09:31:42.000000', 0),
