(2210270, 290249, 16148, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea.  Congratulations on a top 10!</td>', 'Really nice idea.  Congratulations on a top 10!', '2006-03-08 06:46:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2226098, 290246, 42013, '<td valign="top">You rule DPC with the Nikon 7900.  Great creativity on this shot as well.  My only nitpic would be the "oval" sun.</td>', 'You rule DPC with the Nikon 7900.  Great creativity on this shot as well.  My only nitpic would be the "oval" sun.', '2006-03-14 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2263539, 290155, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this photo could be real. I have looked at it so many times, but I still can''t make sense of it.<br/> <br/>There are two fundamental problems I have with it:<br/> <br/>The person''s shadow on the right has a reflection in the water, yet the tree''s shadow on the left does NOT.<br/> <br/>Even more impossible is this: 100% of the shadow is firmly visible against reddish embankment, yet the shadow''s reflection shows head and shoulders against blue sky!!!<br/> <br/>I tried once before to get an explanation for this, but never got an answer :-(  Guess I''ll have to keep wondering about it.</td>', 'I don''t see how this photo could be real. I have looked at it so many times, but I still can''t make sense of it. There are two fundamental problems I have with it: The person''s shadow on the right has a reflection in the water, yet the tree''s shadow on the left does NOT. Even more impossible is this: 100% of the shadow is firmly visible against reddish embankment, yet the shadow''s reflection shows head and shoulders against blue sky!!! I tried once before to get an explanation for this, but never got an answer :-(  Guess I''ll have to keep wondering about it.', '2006-03-27 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2272730, 289913, 48298, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this Challenge, but I absolutely love your humor here.  Adding it to Favs.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this Challenge, but I absolutely love your humor here.  Adding it to Favs.', '2006-03-30 08:19:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2275095, 289913, 34069, '<td valign="top">Too bad I didn''t vote on this challenge.  I really like this.  You''ll have to show us your infamous filter.<br/> <br/>My one suggestion would be to find a place with all blank wall, no door or doorstop in the picture, just you and your shadow.<br/></td>', 'Too bad I didn''t vote on this challenge.  I really like this.  You''ll have to show us your infamous filter. My one suggestion would be to find a place with all blank wall, no door or doorstop in the picture, just you and your shadow.', '2006-03-31 00:09:20.000000', NULL, 0),
