(2601745, 290226, 14986, '<td valign="top">This was a very creative idea and not a bad photo at all.  I think it would have been more effective with the curtain pressed to get rid of the wrinkles.  I would also go over and darken the shadow a bit more.  This is not something I would have thought of and you came up with a good shot.</td>', 'This was a very creative idea and not a bad photo at all.  I think it would have been more effective with the curtain pressed to get rid of the wrinkles.  I would also go over and darken the shadow a bit more.  This is not something I would have thought of and you came up with a good shot.', '2006-07-08 22:27:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2628036, 290285, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m really surprised this didn''t score better.  I doubt it was an easy shot to get this clear and the lines all straight.  I really like the contrasts the the strong form and lines made by the backdrop and shadow.</td>', 'I''m really surprised this didn''t score better.  I doubt it was an easy shot to get this clear and the lines all straight.  I really like the contrasts the the strong form and lines made by the backdrop and shadow.', '2006-07-16 23:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
