(3957597, 290155, 58430, '<td valign="top">IMHO, <br/> <br/>If you notice, the water is very still where the shadow of the person is and there is a nice shadow reflection in the water.  Where the tree is the water is stirred up.  There is a shadow there but it is not clearly reflected because of the movement of water.  Or the grey patch for some reason doesn''t show a shadow for either and the tree''s shadow falls only on the grey patch.<br/> <br/>This is a great shot, Justin.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-01 13:20:46.</i></td>', 'IMHO,  If you notice, the water is very still where the shadow of the person is and there is a nice shadow reflection in the water.  Where the tree is the water is stirred up.  There is a shadow there but it is not clearly reflected because of the movement of water.  Or the grey patch for some reason doesn''t show a shadow for either and the tree''s shadow falls only on the grey patch. This is a great shot, Justin.  ', '2007-08-01 14:06:35.000000', '2007-08-01 14:20:46.000000', 0),
