(6955916, 290190, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>I have humbly accepted the job of commenting on the portfolio of a man who''s mind I lack understanding of. Allow me to say a prayer and dive in!<br/> <br/>A very personal shot. I think adding about a 1/2 stop to the exposure, punching the contrast a touch and skipping the desat would have added more drama. If you ever cut a record, this should be your album cover!</td>', 'Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!  I have humbly accepted the job of commenting on the portfolio of a man who''s mind I lack understanding of. Allow me to say a prayer and dive in! A very personal shot. I think adding about a 1/2 stop to the exposure, punching the contrast a touch and skipping the desat would have added more drama. If you ever cut a record, this should be your album cover!', '2013-01-12 19:52:46.000000', NULL, 0),
